already_registered.body:
Hello {name},

Someone used this email address to sign up, but you already have an account. Sign in here:
{signin_link}

Forgot your password? Reset it here:
{reset_link}

If this was not you, you can ignore this email.

password_changed.body:
Hello {name},

Your password was just changed and you were signed out everywhere else. If this was not you, reset your password now:
{reset_link}

failed_logins.body:
Hello {name},

There were many failed attempts to sign in to your account in the last hour. Your account is not locked. If this was not you, consider changing your password:
{reset_link}
